<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Carso started as hold.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Carso started as hold.</headline>
<dateline>MONTERREY, Mexico 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican brokerage Interacciones said Tuesday they started coverage of Mexican holding Grupo Carso with a hold recommendation estimating earnings for share of 3.02 pesos in 1997 and 4.11 pesos in 1998.</p>
<p>--Analyst Robert Hulme said Carso's acquisitions of Latinca and Sears de Mexico so far in 1997, although made at attractive prices, will dilute profits this year.</p>
<p>((--Mexico City newsroom (525) 7287001)</p>
</text>
